        <div class="tab-content" id="tab-swlist" data-main="software" data-sub="softwarelist">
            <div class="info">
                Every distinct installed program across all devices, with how many carry it, which versions, which
                findings matched it, whether a license was collected and what the last winget run reported. Built from
                the inventory already stored on this server - opening it contacts no device. Hover any button and its
                explanation appears at the lower right; <em>Details</em> opens everything stored about one program on
                demand and is kept in memory while the page is open.
                <br><br>
                <em>Ignore</em>, <em>Update everywhere</em> and <em>Uninstall everywhere</em> need a winget package id,
                because winget manages ids and not display names - rows without one show those buttons disabled.
                Uninstall removes the program from devices and always asks for confirmation first.
            </div>
            <div class="controls">
                <input type="text" id="swfFilter" class="filter-input" placeholder="Filter by software or publisher..." style="min-width:260px;">
                <button id="swfRefreshBtn" class="small" data-help="swf.refresh">Refresh</button>
                <label class="dlselall" data-help="swf.selectupdatable"><input type="checkbox" id="swfSelectUpdatable"> select updatable</label>
                <span id="swfRunInfo" class="hint"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-container">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr>
                        <th style="width:26px;" class="nosort"></th>
                        <th style="cursor:default">Software</th>
                        <th style="cursor:default;width:130px;">Version</th>
                        <th style="cursor:default;width:150px;">Publisher</th>
                        <th style="width:58px;cursor:default">Devices</th>
                        <th style="width:110px;cursor:default">Findings</th>
                        <th style="width:170px;" data-help="swf.runcol">Last winget run</th>
                        <th style="width:60px;cursor:default">License</th>
                        <th style="width:290px;" class="nosort">Actions</th>
                    </tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="swfBody"><tr><td colspan="9" style="color:#888">Loading...</td></tr></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <div class="controls">
                <button class="green" id="swfUpdateAllBtn" data-help="swf.updateall">Update the selected packages everywhere</button>
            </div>
            <div id="swfMsg"></div>
        </div>
